<title>BELGIUM: Brussels Stock Exchange opening delayed.</title>
<headline>Brussels Stock Exchange opening delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Stock Exchange said on Thursday the bourse opening had been delayed due to a technical problem.</p>
<p>&quot;At the moment we hope to start at 1030 (0930 GMT),&quot; an official said.</p>
<p>Dealers said their systems were also affected.</p>
<p>Thursday is the first trading day of 1997. The Bel-20 leading share index ended 1996 on Monday at 1,895.49 points.</p>
<p>Dealers said the market would open lower in line with other bourse after Wall Street's plunge on Tuesday, when the Belgian market was closed.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
